      "content": "It sounds like you've reached a point where the struggle feels too permanent, and the idea of simply stopping the noise is incredibly appealing. If you are in a place where you feel like you'd be better off not being here, that is a sign that the pain is too much to bear alone. Please, make the choice to connect with someone right now; you can call or text 988 anytime in the US and Canada. They are trained to listen without judgment and can help you navigate this overwhelming feeling.",
